TRACING:
- `from tracing import traces` at the top of every file.
- EVERY function/method (public + private) gets a @traces decorator.
- Do NOT put @traces on classes — only on functions and methods.
- Source: `@traces("LLR-XXXX")` — list all LLRs the function implements.
- Tests:  `@traces("LLR-XXXX", case="CASE_XXX")` — include CASE ID.
- Private helpers: trace to ALL LLRs they support.
- Preserve existing @traces decorators.
- NEVER trace dead code. Verify each function's implementation matches
  the wording and intent of the LLR it traces to. If it does not
  implement any requirement, remove it — false traces are a safety violation.